{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24371","headline":"晚春欲携酒寻沈四着作先以六韵寄之 · 白居易","name":"晚春欲携酒寻沈四着作先以六韵寄之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病容衰惨澹，芳景晚蹉跎。\n无计留春得，争能奈老何。\n篇章慵报荅，杯讌喜经过。\n顾我酒狂久，负君诗债多。\n敢辞携绿蚁，只愿见青娥。\n最忆阳关唱，真珠一串歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}